# sdd/templates/behavior.feature.template
# Copy to capabilities/<domain>/<capability-slug>/contracts/behavior.feature.
# Gherkin Given-When-Then; @REQ / @CTR / @risk / @adapter / @hitl 标签强制约定.
#
# Phase M0 skeleton template — 高风险（critical / high）REQ 必填.
# 详 sdd/adapters/bdd-tdd.md §Standards.

@adapter:<adapter-name>  @risk:<critical|high|medium|low>
Feature: <Capability behavior summary>
  As <persona>
  I want <observable outcome>
  So that <business value / safety / compliance reason>

  Background:                                   # optional - 公共 setup
    Given <baseline precondition 1>
    And <baseline precondition 2>

  @REQ-001 @CTR-<contract-slug>                 # 必填 @REQ-NNN + @CTR-<slug> 标签
  Scenario: <Scenario name 1 — 描述具体行为>
    Given <preconditions specific to this scenario>
    When <user / agent action>
    Then <observable result>
    And <secondary assertions>

  @REQ-001 @CTR-<contract-slug>
  Scenario: <Scenario name 2 — 替代场景 / negative case>
    Given <alternative context>
    When <variation>
    Then <expected behavior>

  @REQ-002 @CTR-<contract-slug> @hitl           # @hitl 标签 — 标注本 scenario 涉及 HITL 必停
  Scenario: <HITL-triggered behavior>
    Given <conditions triggering hard stop>
    When <user / agent action>
    Then the agent halts and requests HITL approval
    And no destructive action is performed

# Gherkin 标签约定 (per sdd/adapters/bdd-tdd.md §Standards):
#   @REQ-NNN              — 绑定 capability/requirements.md 的 REQ id (必填)
#   @CTR-<contract-slug>  — 绑定 contracts/<slug>.contract.yml (必填)
#   @risk:<level>         — critical / high / medium / low (Feature 级标签，影响 G19-G22 blocking)
#   @adapter:<name>       — 绑定 sdd/adapters/ 之一 (Feature 级；决定 step 走哪个 fixture)
#   @hitl                 — 标注本 scenario 涉及 HITL 必停 (4 项专属或 §11.5 之一)
